          "value": "<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[type:fortitude|dc:30]</p><p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p><p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 1} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 2</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.MIRkyAjyBeXivMa7]{Enfeebled 2} (1 round)</p><p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @Damage[2d6[poison]] damage and @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.xYTAsEpcJE1Ccni3]{Slowed 1} for 1 hour</p>",
