    {
      "_id": "nzRwoq0ReUWv099i",
      "name": "Infestation",
      "type": "action",
      "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
      "effects": [],
      "folder": null,
      "sort": 100000,
      "flags": {
        "pdfoundry-pf2e": {
          "source": ""
        }
      },
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>An infestation of poisonous spiders, which nest within this creature's exoskeleton, constantly surrounds a deathweb creating a @Template[type:emanation|distance:5]{5 foot} infestation aura. Each enemy that ends its turn in the deathweb's infestation aura takes @Damage[2d6[piercing]] damage with a @Check[type:reflex|dc:30|basic] save.</p><p>A creature that fails its save is exposed to deathweb spider infestation venom.</p><p>Any area effect attack that deals 20 or more points of damage to a deathweb destroys its infesting spiders, removing its aura for 2 rounds, after which a new batch of spiders swarms out of the undead's body to replenish the infestation.</p>",
          "gm": ""
        },
